### 1. Lister tous les appareils (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Accept: application/json

### 2. Créer un nouvel appareil (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SN-A350-001",
  "name": "Capteur Température Cabine",
  "type": "SENSOR",
  "status": "ONLINE"
}